  "summary": "Judicial Watch filed a public records request with the city of Sedona over its installation of 12 Flock Safety ALPR cameras, citing lack of public notice and transparency. The Sedona City Council plans an Aug. 13 work session on the ALPRs, and the system will not be used until after that meeting.",
